      <h1>{{ section.settings.s4 }}</h1>
      <p class="sub"><span class="chip" style="background:var(--stone-sibling-rivalry)"></span>Leopard Salome, Turkey &middot; Amber. Spice. Aromatic.</p>
      <blockquote>{{ section.settings.s5 }}</blockquote>

      <p class="fieldlabel">{{ section.settings.s6 }}</p>
      <div class="sizes" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Size">
        <button aria-current="true" data-size="100ml" data-price="160"><span class="szl">100 ml</span><span class="szp">Dhs. 760</span><span class="szi">a handmade objet d’art</span></button>
        <button data-size="7-5ml" data-price="25"><span class="szl">7.5 ml</span><span class="szp">Dhs. 200</span><span class="szi">Printed sleeve, no story</span></button>
        <button data-size="sample" data-price="5"><span class="szl">Sample &mdash; 2 ml</span><span class="szp">Dhs. 25</span><span class="szi">2ml, and its opening page</span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <button class="btn btn-ink" data-size="100ml" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',this.dataset.size,this)">Add to bag &mdash; Dhs. 760</button>
        <button class="btn btn-ghostink applepay" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',document.querySelector('.pdp .cta .btn-ink').dataset.size||'100ml',this)"><svg class="i-apple" viewBox="0 0 384 512" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5q0 39.3 14.4 81.2c12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.931.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 49.9-11.4 69.5-34.3z"/></svg> Apple Pay</button>
      </div>

      <!-- On a phone the Add button starts below the fold and is gone by the
           second screen. The bar stands in for it whenever the real button is
           not on screen — including on arrival — and restates the chosen size
           and price so it never asks for a decision the reader cannot see. -->
      <div class="pdpbar" id="pdpbar" hidden>
        <div class="r">
          <div class="t"><b>{{ section.settings.s7 }}</b><span data-barprice>Dhs. 760 &middot; 100 ml</span></div>
          <button class="btn btn-ink" data-size="100ml" onclick="addToBag('sibling-rivalry',this.dataset.size,this)">Add to bag</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="acc">
            <details open><summary>{{ section.settings.s8 }}</summary><div class="body">The lights onstage were blinding, but she knew from the cacophony coming from the seats that the ceremony had sold out. She’d always felt at ease in the spotlight, yet it still gave her a thrill to draw such a large crowd. A message from her younger brother — her most adoring fan, and her toughest competitor.</div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s9 }}</summary><div class="body"><p>{{ section.settings.s10 }}</p><div class="notelist"><p><b>{{ section.settings.s11 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s19 }}</span></p><p><b>{{ section.settings.s12 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s20 }}</span></p><p><b>{{ section.settings.s13 }}</b><span>{{ section.settings.s21 }}</span></p></div><p class="hint">{{ section.settings.s14 }}</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s15 }}</summary><div class="body">Leopard Salome, Turkey, hand-cut. Veining is decided by the block, so no two lids repeat. The lid lifts free of the glass and keeps its weight in the hand.</div></details>
            <details><summary>{{ section.settings.s16 }}</summary><div class="body">Complimentary UK delivery over Dhs. 150, otherwise Dhs. 25. Two to four working days, signed for. Non-refundable.</div></details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
